2. What We Will Perform  
In this practical, we will create 3 simple test cases:  
 	Test Case  	Purpose  	Priority  Group  
Login Test  	Verify login  1 Smoke Title Test  	Verify page title  	2 Smoke  
Invalid Login Test Verify invalid login  	3 Regression We will also use:  
●	@BeforeMethod  
●	@AfterMethod  
●	@Test  
●	priority  
●	groups  
●	Assert  
   
